(4117223, 589376, 10686, '<td valign="top">I think the shallow DOF and soft focus don''t get along here</td>', 'I think the shallow DOF and soft focus don''t get along here', '2007-09-26 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117369, 589160, 82088, '<td valign="top">I love the background, it is very soft with the beautiful early morning mist kind of feel, unfortunately, in my opinion, the dog looks very pixely (if thats a word), and I wished the leash were not in the photo.</td>', 'I love the background, it is very soft with the beautiful early morning mist kind of feel, unfortunately, in my opinion, the dog looks very pixely (if thats a word), and I wished the leash were not in the photo.', '2007-09-26 12:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117374, 589943, 82088, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo, the more it intrigues me.  My first thought was that it was not soft focus at all, but rather everything is very much in focus.  But as I look at everything individually, the trees, the house, the boat, the grass, the focus is indeed ever so slightly, soft.  Adding to faves, and giving it a 10, good job. =)</td>', 'The more I look at this photo, the more it intrigues me.  My first thought was that it was not soft focus at all, but rather everything is very much in focus.  But as I look at everything individually, the trees, the house, the boat, the grass, the focus is indeed ever so slightly, soft.  Adding to faves, and giving it a 10, good job. =)', '2007-09-26 12:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117381, 589955, 82088, '<td valign="top">I love the picture, but I dont like the border =(  Still giving it a 7 because the picture is really what matters.</td>', 'I love the picture, but I dont like the border =(  Still giving it a 7 because the picture is really what matters.', '2007-09-26 12:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117385, 590501, 82088, '<td valign="top">I wished this were not so small, and I would have liked to see the arm on the right side of the frame cropped out.  But I love the mood of this picture. The people in the background look painted.</td>', 'I wished this were not so small, and I would have liked to see the arm on the right side of the frame cropped out.  But I love the mood of this picture. The people in the background look painted.', '2007-09-26 12:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
