(4118072, 591453, 34659, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  My only (very slight) criticism is that I think the image could have been even stronger if the bottom had been cropped a bit more - the light green blob in the bottom right is a bit distracting.  Still, this is beautiful work, and one of my top picks for this challenge. 9</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  My only (very slight) criticism is that I think the image could have been even stronger if the bottom had been cropped a bit more - the light green blob in the bottom right is a bit distracting.  Still, this is beautiful work, and one of my top picks for this challenge. 9', '2007-09-26 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118076, 591703, 34659, '<td valign="top">Well, I think we could safely say we''ll see this on the front page...  Stunning portrait.  The fact that you can''t see her eyes is a WONDERFUL choice.  WOW...</td>', 'Well, I think we could safely say we''ll see this on the front page...  Stunning portrait.  The fact that you can''t see her eyes is a WONDERFUL choice.  WOW...', '2007-09-26 17:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
