(4118083, 591513, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very unique take on the challenge.  Full marks for creativity and OOB thinking.  Great job on the composition and negative space.</td>', 'Very unique take on the challenge.  Full marks for creativity and OOB thinking.  Great job on the composition and negative space.', '2007-09-26 17:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118126, 589950, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very lovely!  It suits soft focus very much.  Just out of curiosity....my bet is, you''ll get at least one who comments on the "lighting" aspect....bottom corner and being "blown out"????  I did one not too long ago and got a comment like that.  I really like this shot!  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Very lovely!  It suits soft focus very much.  Just out of curiosity....my bet is, you''ll get at least one who comments on the "lighting" aspect....bottom corner and being "blown out"????  I did one not too long ago and got a comment like that.  I really like this shot!  Very nicely done!', '2007-09-26 17:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118132, 591247, 68947, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!!!!  Really suits the "soft focus" as a subject.  The only thing that I could say on this one would be that the lighting, perhaps, could be a bit better, but then again.....try getting a shot like this and the opportunities.  They don''t come easily, do they? No time to fuss with lighting, I''m sure.  I really like this one.  Tugs at my heart strings.</td>', 'What a cutie!!!!  Really suits the "soft focus" as a subject.  The only thing that I could say on this one would be that the lighting, perhaps, could be a bit better, but then again.....try getting a shot like this and the opportunities.  They don''t come easily, do they? No time to fuss with lighting, I''m sure.  I really like this one.  Tugs at my heart strings.', '2007-09-26 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118148, 591224, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Love the feel and editing that you''ve done. Nicely done!  Reminds me of a Dr. Achoo shot in the Rhythm III challenge in July of this year...only soft focused.  Loved that one too.</td>', 'Lovely!  Love the feel and editing that you''ve done. Nicely done!  Reminds me of a Dr. Achoo shot in the Rhythm III challenge in July of this year...only soft focused.  Loved that one too.', '2007-09-26 17:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
