(4118159, 591513, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Not quite sure on what to say here......just LOL!  Love the title.  Made me smile. And, yeah, scratch my head!  Love the sense of humor to this one!</td>', 'LOL!  Not quite sure on what to say here......just LOL!  Love the title.  Made me smile. And, yeah, scratch my head!  Love the sense of humor to this one!', '2007-09-26 17:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118164, 590245, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  I love the dark moody tones - they really add to the impact.</td>', 'Wonderful!  I love the dark moody tones - they really add to the impact.', '2007-09-26 17:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118167, 590836, 68947, '<td valign="top">I love the "complimentary color" usage to this shot.  I''m just wondering if you''re getting a lot of comments about it not being "soft enough"????  I''ve found that DPC voters take the challenge descriptions quite literally and unless you''ve followed it to a "tee", they''re not going to give it a fair shake.  Hope this isn''t the case with this one because it''s a really lovely shot!</td>', 'I love the "complimentary color" usage to this shot.  I''m just wondering if you''re getting a lot of comments about it not being "soft enough"????  I''ve found that DPC voters take the challenge descriptions quite literally and unless you''ve followed it to a "tee", they''re not going to give it a fair shake.  Hope this isn''t the case with this one because it''s a really lovely shot!', '2007-09-26 17:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118177, 591644, 68947, '<td valign="top">very pretty!  I see where you were going with this and it truly does suit the "soft focus"!  Even the color of background and material used in it truly suits it.  I think that perhaps, had the middle pearls been a little more in focus, it would be a perfect shot!  Nicely done though!</td>', 'very pretty!  I see where you were going with this and it truly does suit the "soft focus"!  Even the color of background and material used in it truly suits it.  I think that perhaps, had the middle pearls been a little more in focus, it would be a perfect shot!  Nicely done though!', '2007-09-26 17:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118179, 590768, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the soft focus on everything but the butterfly!  Nicely done!</td>', 'Love the soft focus on everything but the butterfly!  Nicely done!', '2007-09-26 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118183, 591581, 67723, '<td valign="top">Great location and idea but IMO the quality isn''t the best. It looks smudgy.</td>', 'Great location and idea but IMO the quality isn''t the best. It looks smudgy.', '2007-09-26 18:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118205, 591070, 68947, '<td valign="top">Water has it''s own "soft focus" doesn''t it?  I love that you captured your shot by thinking "outside the box"!  I truly hope that others get this too!  <br/> <br/>Like a calm water''s surface, Life is but a mere reflective illusion.  Only when the surface has been broken, do we see what truly exists.  <br/> <br/>Life has a way of creating those ripples so that we see reality.</td>', 'Water has it''s own "soft focus" doesn''t it?  I love that you captured your shot by thinking "outside the box"!  I truly hope that others get this too!   Like a calm water''s surface, Life is but a mere reflective illusion.  Only when the surface has been broken, do we see what truly exists.   Life has a way of creating those ripples so that we see reality.', '2007-09-26 18:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
