(4119305, 591028, 14620, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  One of my top three.  The colors and tones are lovely.  It''s perfect for this challenge.  Stunning model as well.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  One of my top three.  The colors and tones are lovely.  It''s perfect for this challenge.  Stunning model as well.', '2007-09-27 01:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119310, 591703, 14620, '<td valign="top">So incredibly lovely! All the white with her golden tones, just beautiful.  Lighting is perfect, composition is perfect, softness is just right.</td>', 'So incredibly lovely! All the white with her golden tones, just beautiful.  Lighting is perfect, composition is perfect, softness is just right.', '2007-09-27 01:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119314, 591570, 14620, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this photo that draws me to it.  Perhaps it''s simplicity, maybe it''s the lovely layers that lead me through the image or it could be all the warm tones to it.  Whatever it is, it''s one of my favorites of the challenge.  So peaceful.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this photo that draws me to it.  Perhaps it''s simplicity, maybe it''s the lovely layers that lead me through the image or it could be all the warm tones to it.  Whatever it is, it''s one of my favorites of the challenge.  So peaceful.', '2007-09-27 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119372, 591342, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice try but your main object is to small &amp; centered. It may have looked better with different composition &amp; lighting.</td>', 'Nice try but your main object is to small & centered. It may have looked better with different composition & lighting.', '2007-09-27 02:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119377, 591724, 49643, '<td valign="top">I didn''t understand the theme. Technically it looks out of focus not a soft focus, also composition can be better by tighter cropping.</td>', 'I didn''t understand the theme. Technically it looks out of focus not a soft focus, also composition can be better by tighter cropping.', '2007-09-27 02:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119378, 591590, 49643, '<td valign="top">Sorry I didn''t get it. The image looks quiet busy,reflections of light from glass without the expected soft focus.</td>', 'Sorry I didn''t get it. The image looks quiet busy,reflections of light from glass without the expected soft focus.', '2007-09-27 02:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119382, 589114, 49643, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t see soft focus here &amp; the background is busy enough to distract.</td>', 'Sorry I don''t see soft focus here & the background is busy enough to distract.', '2007-09-27 02:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119383, 591730, 49643, '<td valign="top">The sky is overexposed &amp; poor composition. It doesn''t have soft focus either.</td>', 'The sky is overexposed & poor composition. It doesn''t have soft focus either.', '2007-09-27 02:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119386, 591247, 49643, '<td valign="top">Cute baby but I see lot of noise here with distracting background. The lighting can be better with nice composition.</td>', 'Cute baby but I see lot of noise here with distracting background. The lighting can be better with nice composition.', '2007-09-27 02:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119387, 590424, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice try but poor lighting &amp; soft focus.</td>', 'Nice try but poor lighting & soft focus.', '2007-09-27 02:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119388, 589227, 49643, '<td valign="top">Image looks too busy with poor exposure.</td>', 'Image looks too busy with poor exposure.', '2007-09-27 02:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119389, 591051, 49643, '<td valign="top">The image looks out of focus not soft focus &amp; border is distracting. The lighting can be better.</td>', 'The image looks out of focus not soft focus & border is distracting. The lighting can be better.', '2007-09-27 02:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119390, 589677, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice try to capture the expression but poor lighting.</td>', 'Nice try to capture the expression but poor lighting.', '2007-09-27 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119394, 590866, 49643, '<td valign="top">Poor composition. Tighter cropping may have helped. The image looks blurry to me.</td>', 'Poor composition. Tighter cropping may have helped. The image looks blurry to me.', '2007-09-27 02:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119434, 591139, 81390, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo. I just love it. It''s not your basic humdrum floral photography... it''s awesome. Probably the lighting that does it for me. And it also helps the softness, since the image is overall fairly in focus. The feel is still there.<br/> <br/>Nice, simple border works well. Wouldn''t change this in the slightest.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo. I just love it. It''s not your basic humdrum floral photography... it''s awesome. Probably the lighting that does it for me. And it also helps the softness, since the image is overall fairly in focus. The feel is still there. Nice, simple border works well. Wouldn''t change this in the slightest.', '2007-09-27 03:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119438, 589594, 81390, '<td valign="top">Very nicely softened. The blurring works well on the splashes. Overall it''s very blue, though, and the froth looks pinkish. Still, a neat shot.</td>', 'Very nicely softened. The blurring works well on the splashes. Overall it''s very blue, though, and the froth looks pinkish. Still, a neat shot.', '2007-09-27 03:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119440, 590716, 81390, '<td valign="top">There''s a tiny clip of another petal in the upper left corner that''s nagging at me. Couple of hot pixels in the middle as well, but with Basic, hey, what can you do? Nicely done, and true to the challenge.</td>', 'There''s a tiny clip of another petal in the upper left corner that''s nagging at me. Couple of hot pixels in the middle as well, but with Basic, hey, what can you do? Nicely done, and true to the challenge.', '2007-09-27 03:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119441, 591714, 81390, '<td valign="top">A bit too sharp on the leaves for me, especially compared to the right half of the photo, which is quite nice and soft. On the other hand, you captured the separate rays beautifully and completely without lens flare! I''d say it communicates something, all right.</td>', 'A bit too sharp on the leaves for me, especially compared to the right half of the photo, which is quite nice and soft. On the other hand, you captured the separate rays beautifully and completely without lens flare! I''d say it communicates something, all right.', '2007-09-27 03:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119442, 591678, 81390, '<td valign="top">With just one of these statues, there would be a more distinguished effect, but with two, I can''t get much of an interpretation out of it. Lighting turned out nicely, but I''d soften the focus to get a dreamlike look in this case.</td>', 'With just one of these statues, there would be a more distinguished effect, but with two, I can''t get much of an interpretation out of it. Lighting turned out nicely, but I''d soften the focus to get a dreamlike look in this case.', '2007-09-27 03:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119445, 590812, 81390, '<td valign="top">Great focal work. Coloring seems a bit off, overly yellow. Actually, it seems as though it can''t decide whether it wants to be bright or subdued... trapped in the middle somewhere.</td>', 'Great focal work. Coloring seems a bit off, overly yellow. Actually, it seems as though it can''t decide whether it wants to be bright or subdued... trapped in the middle somewhere.', '2007-09-27 03:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119446, 591644, 81390, '<td valign="top">Definitely soft. Wow. Maybe even overdoing it. But I do think this epitomizes the challenge, and the setup is very nice.</td>', 'Definitely soft. Wow. Maybe even overdoing it. But I do think this epitomizes the challenge, and the setup is very nice.', '2007-09-27 03:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119447, 591298, 81390, '<td valign="top">This looks more out of focus than softly focused. Good arrangement of subjects, and a silly but pleasing little addition that the frame has soft edges too.</td>', 'This looks more out of focus than softly focused. Good arrangement of subjects, and a silly but pleasing little addition that the frame has soft edges too.', '2007-09-27 03:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119450, 591028, 81390, '<td valign="top">Her left eyeball (HER left) is obscured by a water droplet. It makes an otherwise tranquil image ring of cyborgs and darker things. Otherwise, it looks very good. Her elbow might want more room in the frame, but I''d have to see to know. In all, I''m getting an effect from the softness, and that was the idea, so I''ll take it! :)</td>', 'Her left eyeball (HER left) is obscured by a water droplet. It makes an otherwise tranquil image ring of cyborgs and darker things. Otherwise, it looks very good. Her elbow might want more room in the frame, but I''d have to see to know. In all, I''m getting an effect from the softness, and that was the idea, so I''ll take it! :)', '2007-09-27 03:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119453, 591159, 81390, '<td valign="top">Background''s a little oversaturated to be reminiscent of autumn, but the angle is fabulous and your focus turned out beautifully. An easy vote for me.</td>', 'Background''s a little oversaturated to be reminiscent of autumn, but the angle is fabulous and your focus turned out beautifully. An easy vote for me.', '2007-09-27 03:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119455, 591789, 81390, '<td valign="top">Cluttered, but it is indeed soft.</td>', 'Cluttered, but it is indeed soft.', '2007-09-27 03:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119457, 591081, 81390, '<td valign="top">Too much fuzzy, too little softness. The way I interpret the difference is that soft focus means the highlights, primarily, are blurred, and not so much all the other values.</td>', 'Too much fuzzy, too little softness. The way I interpret the difference is that soft focus means the highlights, primarily, are blurred, and not so much all the other values.', '2007-09-27 03:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119459, 589677, 81390, '<td valign="top">What would be a great picture just needs a little more light from the left, so we can pick out the subject more easily. The focus is pulled off quite well, though.</td>', 'What would be a great picture just needs a little more light from the left, so we can pick out the subject more easily. The focus is pulled off quite well, though.', '2007-09-27 03:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119462, 591646, 81390, '<td valign="top">I see depth of focus over soft focus in this. It would probably work better for softness to have those petals sticking out to the side be blurred as well, but obviously that''s hard given our choices in Basic editing.</td>', 'I see depth of focus over soft focus in this. It would probably work better for softness to have those petals sticking out to the side be blurred as well, but obviously that''s hard given our choices in Basic editing.', '2007-09-27 03:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119479, 591793, 63812, '<td valign="top">good idea</td>', 'good idea', '2007-09-27 04:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119482, 591798, 63812, '<td valign="top">pretty image...</td>', 'pretty image...', '2007-09-27 04:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119538, 591535, 17513, '<td valign="top">a very simple picture yet stunning.i love how the colours work together.and the soft focus is just perfect</td>', 'a very simple picture yet stunning.i love how the colours work together.and the soft focus is just perfect', '2007-09-27 05:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
