(4119661, 591273, 74821, '<td valign="top">Nice but the red light pulls my eye to the left and I have to struggle to see what in on the right.  Maybe if you cropped the red light out it would be a better image for me.</td>', 'Nice but the red light pulls my eye to the left and I have to struggle to see what in on the right.  Maybe if you cropped the red light out it would be a better image for me.', '2007-09-27 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
