(4119690, 591372, 63218, '<td valign="top">The title made me take a 2nd look.  What was a very nice shot became poignant.  Very well done! 10 &amp; a fav</td>', 'The title made me take a 2nd look.  What was a very nice shot became poignant.  Very well done! 10 & a fav', '2007-09-27 08:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
