(4119984, 591574, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cant quite put my finger on why I love this shot. Has a cool painting like feel  to it. The color tones are interesting and the green boots stand out just right. I just find this to be an overall pleasing image. I scored you a 9 and I have this as my fave in the challenge. It probably isnt scoring real good for you, but know you have at least one major fan right here. Good luck!</td>', 'Cant quite put my finger on why I love this shot. Has a cool painting like feel  to it. The color tones are interesting and the green boots stand out just right. I just find this to be an overall pleasing image. I scored you a 9 and I have this as my fave in the challenge. It probably isnt scoring real good for you, but know you have at least one major fan right here. Good luck!', '2007-09-27 12:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
