(4120021, 590348, 82749, '<td valign="top">Outstanding colors, love the details on the one in the middle (veins in particular), like how you managed to still keep much of the detail on the "softer" parts on the right and left.  Composition is great as well.</td>', 'Outstanding colors, love the details on the one in the middle (veins in particular), like how you managed to still keep much of the detail on the "softer" parts on the right and left.  Composition is great as well.', '2007-09-27 12:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
