(4125479, 591820, 84520, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea and the composition, but I feel that the ''wrinkles'' dont stick out as much as they should--if you''re using a narrow depth of field, you need to have the in focus areas in better focus.</td>', 'I really like the idea and the composition, but I feel that the ''wrinkles'' dont stick out as much as they should--if you''re using a narrow depth of field, you need to have the in focus areas in better focus.', '2007-09-30 04:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
