(4125764, 591527, 84440, '<td valign="top">I like the effect. However, I feel like the photo leans to the left. I can see that the far chimney lines up vertically but the average vertical line leans to the left. In this case, I would probably try different slight rotations until the photo "feels" right. The photo would work better for me if there was some area of higher focus, but I guess that is the challenge of soft focus.</td>', 'I like the effect. However, I feel like the photo leans to the left. I can see that the far chimney lines up vertically but the average vertical line leans to the left. In this case, I would probably try different slight rotations until the photo "feels" right. The photo would work better for me if there was some area of higher focus, but I guess that is the challenge of soft focus.', '2007-09-30 10:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125766, 589606, 84440, '<td valign="top">Beautiful simple landscape. However, I don''t think this scene lends itself to soft focus - although the landscape effect is soft and subtle.</td>', 'Beautiful simple landscape. However, I don''t think this scene lends itself to soft focus - although the landscape effect is soft and subtle.', '2007-09-30 10:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125769, 591816, 84440, '<td valign="top">this image is quite dark on my screen. Using a small flashlight to illuminate the flower center would improve the photo in my opinion.</td>', 'this image is quite dark on my screen. Using a small flashlight to illuminate the flower center would improve the photo in my opinion.', '2007-09-30 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125772, 591631, 84440, '<td valign="top">To me this photo is interesting if the distracting elements in the back are cropped away.</td>', 'To me this photo is interesting if the distracting elements in the back are cropped away.', '2007-09-30 11:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
