(4126829, 591777, 48697, '<td valign="top">Your model doesn''t look happy..lol. Your white balance seems to be off a bit, the lighitng seems yellow.</td>', 'Your model doesn''t look happy..lol. Your white balance seems to be off a bit, the lighitng seems yellow.', '2007-10-01 00:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126835, 590501, 48697, '<td valign="top">cute shot but the photo seesm a bit small.</td>', 'cute shot but the photo seesm a bit small.', '2007-10-01 00:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126840, 591724, 48697, '<td valign="top">looks more oof than it does soft, imo.</td>', 'looks more oof than it does soft, imo.', '2007-10-01 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126845, 591139, 48697, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting!</td>', 'beautiful lighting!', '2007-10-01 00:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126850, 589677, 48697, '<td valign="top">The shadows seem too dark, I would have liked to see some sort of detail in the shadows or at least the eyes.</td>', 'The shadows seem too dark, I would have liked to see some sort of detail in the shadows or at least the eyes.', '2007-10-01 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126854, 591673, 48697, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and nice model. the lighting seems a bit harsh on her though.</td>', 'Nice portrait and nice model. the lighting seems a bit harsh on her though.', '2007-10-01 00:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126857, 591342, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool shot but the spider is so small in the frame it lacks impact. Maybe a closer crop and more off centered composition could help a bit.</td>', 'Cool shot but the spider is so small in the frame it lacks impact. Maybe a closer crop and more off centered composition could help a bit.', '2007-10-01 00:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126865, 591689, 48697, '<td valign="top">cute shot, love the b&amp;w treatment as it fits the mode of the shot!</td>', 'cute shot, love the b&w treatment as it fits the mode of the shot!', '2007-10-01 00:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126871, 591372, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, I love the colors and the tractor but I feel the slanted crop takes away from the beauty of the landscape.</td>', 'Cool photo, I love the colors and the tractor but I feel the slanted crop takes away from the beauty of the landscape.', '2007-10-01 00:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126877, 591574, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the old feel the shot has to it, intresting reflection and what is up with the lime green boots!?...lol</td>', 'I like the old feel the shot has to it, intresting reflection and what is up with the lime green boots!?...lol', '2007-10-01 00:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126879, 591684, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Nice leading line and foggy atmosphere. I would lov eto see this in b&amp;w as well!</td>', 'Cool shot! Nice leading line and foggy atmosphere. I would lov eto see this in b&w as well!', '2007-10-01 00:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126880, 591780, 48697, '<td valign="top">The border seems a bit distracting.</td>', 'The border seems a bit distracting.', '2007-10-01 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126883, 591619, 48697, '<td valign="top">What a cool clock, nice composition.</td>', 'What a cool clock, nice composition.', '2007-10-01 00:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126890, 590252, 48697, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could use some contrast and the motion blur of the arm distracts from the beautiful eyes.</td>', 'Looks like it could use some contrast and the motion blur of the arm distracts from the beautiful eyes.', '2007-10-01 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126896, 589160, 48697, '<td valign="top">there seems to be a strange blue lens flare in front of the dog and the filter that was used has given the do a wierd halo.</td>', 'there seems to be a strange blue lens flare in front of the dog and the filter that was used has given the do a wierd halo.', '2007-10-01 00:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126898, 591051, 48697, '<td valign="top">seems a bit more oof than soft, imo.</td>', 'seems a bit more oof than soft, imo.', '2007-10-01 00:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126902, 591222, 48697, '<td valign="top">lol...great creative take in the challenge.</td>', 'lol...great creative take in the challenge.', '2007-10-01 00:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126904, 591513, 48697, '<td valign="top">What a wild shot, very cool.</td>', 'What a wild shot, very cool.', '2007-10-01 00:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126907, 590147, 48697, '<td valign="top">seems a bit grainy.</td>', 'seems a bit grainy.', '2007-10-01 00:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126967, 591247, 48697, '<td valign="top">The noise of this image really distracts from the subject as does the lack of lighting.</td>', 'The noise of this image really distracts from the subject as does the lack of lighting.', '2007-10-01 01:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126981, 591748, 48697, '<td valign="top">The eyes in this shot do not appear to be real or are overdone, although by the title that may have been you intention.</td>', 'The eyes in this shot do not appear to be real or are overdone, although by the title that may have been you intention.', '2007-10-01 01:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4126993, 591028, 48697, '<td valign="top">very nicely done, beautiful!</td>', 'very nicely done, beautiful!', '2007-10-01 01:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127322, 591533, 81213, '<td valign="top">It''s very dark on my screen. But I actually like it when I view it on my mac... 6!</td>', 'It''s very dark on my screen. But I actually like it when I view it on my mac... 6!', '2007-10-01 02:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127906, 591051, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the composition, but the focus is a little too soft for my preferences. I like the muted colors and backlighting very much. 5</td>', 'I like the concept and the composition, but the focus is a little too soft for my preferences. I like the muted colors and backlighting very much. 5', '2007-10-01 08:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127925, 590941, 63398, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I gave this a 3. You cropped this so close that I can''t tell for sure that you got all the subject, and the sign/billboard to the upper right is *very* distracting. And dare I say it? It''s too much in focus! On the upside, it''s a very interesting composition, and with a little work, unfortunately outside the Basic Editing guidelines, it can be a stellar image. Please accept this critique as 1. Subjective, and 2. Intended to be constructive. Good luck in the challenge,</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I gave this a 3. You cropped this so close that I can''t tell for sure that you got all the subject, and the sign/billboard to the upper right is *very* distracting. And dare I say it? It''s too much in focus! On the upside, it''s a very interesting composition, and with a little work, unfortunately outside the Basic Editing guidelines, it can be a stellar image. Please accept this critique as 1. Subjective, and 2. Intended to be constructive. Good luck in the challenge,', '2007-10-01 09:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127940, 591724, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is hard......I gave this a 3 for a couple of reasons. It''s too out of focus, and there is no way because of that for me to tell what this man''s expression is like that made you want to convey ths image. Though from a technical side, you made the error of having his head almost directly centered, his angle shifts the whole subject off to the left leaving me with an unbalanced feeling. A tigfhter crop at the top to eliminate the tree would have been helpful as well. I hope you find my comment constructive and helpful.</td>', 'This is hard......I gave this a 3 for a couple of reasons. It''s too out of focus, and there is no way because of that for me to tell what this man''s expression is like that made you want to convey ths image. Though from a technical side, you made the error of having his head almost directly centered, his angle shifts the whole subject off to the left leaving me with an unbalanced feeling. A tigfhter crop at the top to eliminate the tree would have been helpful as well. I hope you find my comment constructive and helpful.', '2007-10-01 09:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127980, 591514, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like this.......but I have some input on why I voted this a 5 and not higher which it has the potential for IMO. I don''t know if it''s intentional, but it seems washed to me, and I don''t think that does your model justice. I don''t know what "factionnaire" means, I have a voluminous vocabulary *and* it won''t come up on Wikipedia or Google, so I cannot derive any message from the title. That doesn''t help. Also, that sill, or trim piece above her left forearm is distracting.<br/> <br/>The good stuff that pulled all of that out of the fire: The lighting is truly excellent; the balance of light on her face, yet having that glorious negative dark space behind her is just exquisite! And her pensive expression leaves me wanting to know more. Good use of soft focus to assist the contemplative nature of the shot, while still having enough detail to make this ethereal looking woman still appear real. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I like this.......but I have some input on why I voted this a 5 and not higher which it has the potential for IMO. I don''t know if it''s intentional, but it seems washed to me, and I don''t think that does your model justice. I don''t know what "factionnaire" means, I have a voluminous vocabulary *and* it won''t come up on Wikipedia or Google, so I cannot derive any message from the title. That doesn''t help. Also, that sill, or trim piece above her left forearm is distracting. The good stuff that pulled all of that out of the fire: The lighting is truly excellent; the balance of light on her face, yet having that glorious negative dark space behind her is just exquisite! And her pensive expression leaves me wanting to know more. Good use of soft focus to assist the contemplative nature of the shot, while still having enough detail to make this ethereal looking woman still appear real. Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-10-01 09:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
