(4135048, 591028, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Looks almost like a painting.  Love the soft light as well.  Hope it ribbons!</td>', 'Very pretty.  Looks almost like a painting.  Love the soft light as well.  Hope it ribbons!', '2007-10-02 23:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
