(4135120, 591590, 50695, '<td valign="top">this stunned me right from the thumbnail. Brilliant. Thank you!<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> Posthumous Blue Ribbon</td>', 'this stunned me right from the thumbnail. Brilliant. Thank you!  Posthumous Blue Ribbon', '2007-10-02 23:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135125, 591574, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is insane. I love it, of course.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> Posthumous Red Ribbon</td>', 'Wow. This is insane. I love it, of course.  Posthumous Red Ribbon', '2007-10-02 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135127, 589114, 50695, '<td valign="top">The wannabe Goths could learn a thing or two from you. This is spot on Noir scariness. I want to see this movie.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/> Posthumous Yellow Ribbon</td>', 'The wannabe Goths could learn a thing or two from you. This is spot on Noir scariness. I want to see this movie.  Posthumous Yellow Ribbon', '2007-10-02 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135254, 591533, 23002, '<td valign="top">The majority of this flower is in perfect focus, just a little bit of it is soft.  It appears to be underexposed or that the shadow/highlight tool was used to pull the hightlights down too much.<br/> <br/>I do like the composition and the flower though. :)</td>', 'The majority of this flower is in perfect focus, just a little bit of it is soft.  It appears to be underexposed or that the shadow/highlight tool was used to pull the hightlights down too much. I do like the composition and the flower though. :)', '2007-10-02 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135268, 591767, 23002, '<td valign="top">I fail to see how the soft focus of the nurse in the background adds to the photo.<br/> <br/>If I was a parent I am sure I would not be affected as much by the "ick" factor of this shot.<br/> <br/>Congrats to the new parents though, I hope your child has a happy and full life. :)</td>', 'I fail to see how the soft focus of the nurse in the background adds to the photo. If I was a parent I am sure I would not be affected as much by the "ick" factor of this shot. Congrats to the new parents though, I hope your child has a happy and full life. :)', '2007-10-02 23:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135279, 591531, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great photo, great exposure, powerful image.  those are the good things.<br/> <br/>The bad thing is that the soft focus of the back half of the picture does not "add" to the photo.  I do love the shot, but not as a soft focus entry. it is a 5 here, but totally sharp from front to back and in a free study or something it would be an 8.</td>', 'Great photo, great exposure, powerful image.  those are the good things. The bad thing is that the soft focus of the back half of the picture does not "add" to the photo.  I do love the shot, but not as a soft focus entry. it is a 5 here, but totally sharp from front to back and in a free study or something it would be an 8.', '2007-10-02 23:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135285, 591684, 23002, '<td valign="top">My 5th shot voted on in this challenge and the first one to actually meet the challenge description!<br/> <br/>Great job with the DOF in the front, the mist and the character walking the line are great.  The leading lines work well.  This is a wonderful shot and a great example of soft focus. 8</td>', 'My 5th shot voted on in this challenge and the first one to actually meet the challenge description! Great job with the DOF in the front, the mist and the character walking the line are great.  The leading lines work well.  This is a wonderful shot and a great example of soft focus. 8', '2007-10-02 23:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135290, 590245, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great soft focus effect here.  Nice balance to the photo.  Great exposure. Good muted colour.  Not big on the frame. 7</td>', 'Great soft focus effect here.  Nice balance to the photo.  Great exposure. Good muted colour.  Not big on the frame. 7', '2007-10-02 23:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135294, 590424, 23002, '<td valign="top">Some highlights in their eyes would have helped a great deal.  I do not see where the intentional soft focus is in the shot.  (there is a difference between intentional soft focus and accidental OOF) 4</td>', 'Some highlights in their eyes would have helped a great deal.  I do not see where the intentional soft focus is in the shot.  (there is a difference between intentional soft focus and accidental OOF) 4', '2007-10-02 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135297, 591748, 23002, '<td valign="top">Is that a doll or is there way to much neat image going on here?  The face is in sharp focus, so the soft focus in this shot (her chest area) does not add to the photo.  4</td>', 'Is that a doll or is there way to much neat image going on here?  The face is in sharp focus, so the soft focus in this shot (her chest area) does not add to the photo.  4', '2007-10-02 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135300, 591412, 23002, '<td valign="top">Sorry but there is a big difference between soft focus areas to add to a photo and and OOF subject.  Nice colourful flowers though. 4</td>', 'Sorry but there is a big difference between soft focus areas to add to a photo and and OOF subject.  Nice colourful flowers though. 4', '2007-10-02 23:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135307, 591826, 23002, '<td valign="top">If the nose was in perfect focus, with the rest being soft, it would have been a great entry.  Unfortunately the nose is not in good enough focus.  (and brush his teeth....LOL) 5</td>', 'If the nose was in perfect focus, with the rest being soft, it would have been a great entry.  Unfortunately the nose is not in good enough focus.  (and brush his teeth....LOL) 5', '2007-10-02 23:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135317, 591278, 23002, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Perhaps a tiny bit overexposed but a nice muted effect.  (muted swan..hahaha) 7</td>', 'Beautiful.  Perhaps a tiny bit overexposed but a nice muted effect.  (muted swan..hahaha) 7', '2007-10-02 23:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135324, 590501, 23002, '<td valign="top">First I would crop the bit of arm on the right side, but then the subject would be too close to the edge. :(<br/> <br/>Not sure how the soft focus adds to the photo here. 5</td>', 'First I would crop the bit of arm on the right side, but then the subject would be too close to the edge. :( Not sure how the soft focus adds to the photo here. 5', '2007-10-03 00:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135332, 590496, 23002, '<td valign="top">nice leading lines in the shot, but I do not think that adding a slight blur after the fact in editing helps the image at all.  The soft focus should be natural, and something in the shot should be in focus. 5</td>', 'nice leading lines in the shot, but I do not think that adding a slight blur after the fact in editing helps the image at all.  The soft focus should be natural, and something in the shot should be in focus. 5', '2007-10-03 00:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135338, 591619, 23002, '<td valign="top">nice powerful shot.  not sure how the softness adds to the photo though. There is a difference between OOF and having the majority of the photo be soft on purpose. 4</td>', 'nice powerful shot.  not sure how the softness adds to the photo though. There is a difference between OOF and having the majority of the photo be soft on purpose. 4', '2007-10-03 00:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135343, 591803, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great example of soft focus adding to the overall composition. A small part of the photo in sharp focus, balanced by a large soft focus area. nice balanced composition too. 7</td>', 'Great example of soft focus adding to the overall composition. A small part of the photo in sharp focus, balanced by a large soft focus area. nice balanced composition too. 7', '2007-10-03 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135346, 591724, 23002, '<td valign="top">there is a big difference between OOF and having part of the photo be soft on purpose to add to the photo. 3</td>', 'there is a big difference between OOF and having part of the photo be soft on purpose to add to the photo. 3', '2007-10-03 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135353, 591784, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Nice example of how a sharp area surrounded by soft focus can add to a photo.  You get the concept! 8</td>', 'Great shot!  Nice example of how a sharp area surrounded by soft focus can add to a photo.  You get the concept! 8', '2007-10-03 00:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
