(4136080, 591798, 62318, '<td valign="top">ISO 400 with a tripod, makes me chuckle. Like the thought out technique of reversing your lens. This is actually a very cool photo. The textures of the leaf edges are enhanced by the two tone palette. It creates a nice serene mood. I''m actually surprised this did not score in the sixes. I would have given you a 7 myself.</td>', 'ISO 400 with a tripod, makes me chuckle. Like the thought out technique of reversing your lens. This is actually a very cool photo. The textures of the leaf edges are enhanced by the two tone palette. It creates a nice serene mood. I''m actually surprised this did not score in the sixes. I would have given you a 7 myself.', '2007-10-03 03:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136084, 589167, 62318, '<td valign="top">A nice study of pattern. The softness in the shadow of the leaves creates a wonderful effect. I think some of the specialness of this photo gets lost in the top left corner as it doesn''t seem to jive with the rest. Still an interesting photo and should have done better in this challenge.</td>', 'A nice study of pattern. The softness in the shadow of the leaves creates a wonderful effect. I think some of the specialness of this photo gets lost in the top left corner as it doesn''t seem to jive with the rest. Still an interesting photo and should have done better in this challenge.', '2007-10-03 03:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136088, 591633, 62318, '<td valign="top">You make this photography stuff seem too easy. Wonderful soft effect and lovely colors. Congrats on another terrific capture and score.</td>', 'You make this photography stuff seem too easy. Wonderful soft effect and lovely colors. Congrats on another terrific capture and score.', '2007-10-03 03:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
