(4136167, 591784, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lisa, beautiful colours and a photo that is both soft and focused simultaneously.  Think it is one of those pictures that either strikes a huge chord with people or doesnt (just look at the average score of your commenters!!!!) and I have to say that for me, as with many of your images it really really works</td>', 'Lisa, beautiful colours and a photo that is both soft and focused simultaneously.  Think it is one of those pictures that either strikes a huge chord with people or doesnt (just look at the average score of your commenters!!!!) and I have to say that for me, as with many of your images it really really works', '2007-10-03 04:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136169, 589054, 68035, '<td valign="top">Roz <br/> <br/>I hate you!!!!  A couple of weeks ago I took some photos of frogs which I truly beleived were the best ever to be taken of our amphibian buddies and then I see this and I realise that you just blew my efforts away<br/> <br/>Great that you got a 6+ but deserved even more<br/> <br/>Beautiful and brilliant and colours to die for<br/> <br/>Fantastic job!!!!</td>', 'Roz  I hate you!!!!  A couple of weeks ago I took some photos of frogs which I truly beleived were the best ever to be taken of our amphibian buddies and then I see this and I realise that you just blew my efforts away Great that you got a 6+ but deserved even more Beautiful and brilliant and colours to die for Fantastic job!!!!', '2007-10-03 04:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
