(4136307, 589614, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image and great title. Congrats on your first ribbon and PB, James.</td>', 'Gorgeous image and great title. Congrats on your first ribbon and PB, James.', '2007-10-03 06:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136324, 591633, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think your experiments worked out well and you hit on the secret to this challenge, which was judged a bit more as very shallow DOF rather than overall softness.  You managed to combine both quite nicely!</td>', 'I think your experiments worked out well and you hit on the secret to this challenge, which was judged a bit more as very shallow DOF rather than overall softness.  You managed to combine both quite nicely!', '2007-10-03 06:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136325, 589167, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the slight distortion the umbrella gives the shadows as they move from one section to the next.  And pleased to see this was a Team Suck-mate''s shot - I thought this was a very good approach to the challenge!</td>', 'I like the slight distortion the umbrella gives the shadows as they move from one section to the next.  And pleased to see this was a Team Suck-mate''s shot - I thought this was a very good approach to the challenge!', '2007-10-03 06:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136334, 591798, 30982, '<td valign="top">Truly a beautiful piece.  It seems as though it''s the view of someone underwater, trying to decide if going back up was worth disturbing the peacefulness of the leaves.  Very interesting technique to get the softness, and I think the high ISO actually helped in this case.</td>', 'Truly a beautiful piece.  It seems as though it''s the view of someone underwater, trying to decide if going back up was worth disturbing the peacefulness of the leaves.  Very interesting technique to get the softness, and I think the high ISO actually helped in this case.', '2007-10-03 06:51:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136335, 591647, 24961, '<td valign="top">bassman7, this is so funny because this picture is UNPROCESSED. It was shot through a curtain so it meets the challenge by how it is done and not like a wining one with using overdose of noise reduction.</td>', 'bassman7, this is so funny because this picture is UNPROCESSED. It was shot through a curtain so it meets the challenge by how it is done and not like a wining one with using overdose of noise reduction.', '2007-10-03 06:52:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136336, 589950, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, great soft focus. Congratulations on winning the yellow, Nilesh.</td>', 'Beautiful image, great soft focus. Congratulations on winning the yellow, Nilesh.', '2007-10-03 06:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136342, 591533, 30982, '<td valign="top">It is a little dark but I assume it''s intended to be, and I like it that way.  Maybe not soft enough for the voters, but definitely not sharp enough for a normal challenge here.  I think it worked quite well.</td>', 'It is a little dark but I assume it''s intended to be, and I like it that way.  Maybe not soft enough for the voters, but definitely not sharp enough for a normal challenge here.  I think it worked quite well.', '2007-10-03 06:53:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136352, 591070, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I love your comments.  I think reflections were a good choice for this challenge and I do like the ripples and don''t think it hurts that they''re in focus - the overall impression is indeed "soft".</td>', 'LOL!  I love your comments.  I think reflections were a good choice for this challenge and I do like the ripples and don''t think it hurts that they''re in focus - the overall impression is indeed "soft".', '2007-10-03 06:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136359, 591820, 30982, '<td valign="top">Exquisite light.  I love that you included the lower bloom in this - would not have been nearly as nice without it.  Had to check, but I scored both you and Don the same - you were both in my top 10.</td>', 'Exquisite light.  I love that you included the lower bloom in this - would not have been nearly as nice without it.  Had to check, but I scored both you and Don the same - you were both in my top 10.', '2007-10-03 06:59:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136366, 589355, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject for the challenge - really does look quite idyllic.  I can see maybe cropping the top to get rid of the bit of open lit space on the upper left - when I scroll down a bit to do that, the shutter of the house and the light green bits of the willow become more prominent.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject for the challenge - really does look quite idyllic.  I can see maybe cropping the top to get rid of the bit of open lit space on the upper left - when I scroll down a bit to do that, the shutter of the house and the light green bits of the willow become more prominent.', '2007-10-03 07:02:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136371, 591798, 40973, '<td valign="top">Time to put the scuba gear on and clean the swimming pool.<br/> <br/>This has a very nice dreamy quality to it - I love images reduced to shapes and light.</td>', 'Time to put the scuba gear on and clean the swimming pool. This has a very nice dreamy quality to it - I love images reduced to shapes and light.', '2007-10-03 07:04:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136372, 591298, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great and imaginative idea, Shez!  While I like the approach for this challenge, I also hope you took some with the blooms in focus as I think that would be pretty cool, with the rest of the plant encased in ice.</td>', 'What a great and imaginative idea, Shez!  While I like the approach for this challenge, I also hope you took some with the blooms in focus as I think that would be pretty cool, with the rest of the plant encased in ice.', '2007-10-03 07:04:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136377, 591724, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - and one helluva nice profile pic it will be, too!  Congrats (?) on the ribbon!</td>', 'Heh - and one helluva nice profile pic it will be, too!  Congrats (?) on the ribbon!', '2007-10-03 07:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136379, 590496, 40973, '<td valign="top">Finally, a good use for those things in hotel rooms. Lovely lighting.</td>', 'Finally, a good use for those things in hotel rooms. Lovely lighting.', '2007-10-03 07:08:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136381, 590770, 30982, '<td valign="top">No comments during the challenge?  There''s a gif for that, you know - you can find it on my profile page.  :-)  I like the combination of softness and very shallow DOF here.  Great color, too.</td>', 'No comments during the challenge?  There''s a gif for that, you know - you can find it on my profile page.  :-)  I like the combination of softness and very shallow DOF here.  Great color, too.', '2007-10-03 07:09:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136386, 591605, 30982, '<td valign="top">The DQ sucks but this is an awesome portrait, which is far, far more important than a score at DPC.  You really did nail the challenge with this one.  Lighting is perfect, great composition as well.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'The DQ sucks but this is an awesome portrait, which is far, far more important than a score at DPC.  You really did nail the challenge with this one.  Lighting is perfect, great composition as well.  Very nicely done!', '2007-10-03 07:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136398, 591724, 40973, '<td valign="top">Finally, we get to see Alan. This is better than most of my self portraits.</td>', 'Finally, we get to see Alan. This is better than most of my self portraits.', '2007-10-03 07:16:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136435, 591691, 20941, '<td valign="top">wonderful entry for this challenge! the white cup adds a lovely contrast in a well placed composition. Gave this a 9 and hoped to see it on the front page. awesome work girl, those stockings worked beautifully!!</td>', 'wonderful entry for this challenge! the white cup adds a lovely contrast in a well placed composition. Gave this a 9 and hoped to see it on the front page. awesome work girl, those stockings worked beautifully!!', '2007-10-03 07:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136467, 591798, 69008, '<td valign="top">That is a lovely effect. It looks very much like a foggy morning shot.</td>', 'That is a lovely effect. It looks very much like a foggy morning shot.', '2007-10-03 08:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136501, 591748, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a captivating shot, and you make a beautiful model.  I am impressed with the sharp focus and strong eyes and lips, and the way the lighting makes your nose almost disappear. My first impression was that this was shot with an f 1.4 or  f 1.2 however  I see that you used 4.5 aperture and lighting to get the shallow DOF effect. Excellent, and well worth a minute of study. The title fits well too.</td>', 'This is a captivating shot, and you make a beautiful model.  I am impressed with the sharp focus and strong eyes and lips, and the way the lighting makes your nose almost disappear. My first impression was that this was shot with an f 1.4 or  f 1.2 however  I see that you used 4.5 aperture and lighting to get the shallow DOF effect. Excellent, and well worth a minute of study. The title fits well too.', '2007-10-03 08:32:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136512, 589950, 49643, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot to all the commentators &amp; voters who appreciated this image. I am really happy to win this ribbon its like a dream come true to me &amp; I have no fear about DQ this time since the image already have been validated. The main reason for happiness is I was able to win with the limitations of equipments :)</td>', 'Thanks a lot to all the commentators & voters who appreciated this image. I am really happy to win this ribbon its like a dream come true to me & I have no fear about DQ this time since the image already have been validated. The main reason for happiness is I was able to win with the limitations of equipments :)', '2007-10-03 08:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136520, 591748, 37961, '<td valign="top">Pretty amazing. Looks synthetic. Great light.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-03 08:42:58.</i></td>', 'Pretty amazing. Looks synthetic. Great light.', '2007-10-03 08:45:31.000000', '2007-10-03 09:42:58.000000', 0),
