(4139067, 591453, 83590, '<td valign="top">Thank you all very much for your kind comments (and votes!) - they mean a lot to me. This is a really good website you have here - I''m having a ball and learning more about photography than from any other thing I''ve tried.<br/> <br/>The picture is of our 12 year old female german shepherd Clover. She''s deaf as a post, ricketty with arthritus, thinks she''s human, and the best mate you could ever ask for. We love her to bits. <br/> <br/>As for the photo - I was out in the yard playing with my new 85mm f/1.8 when something caught her attention. I quickly hit the ground and snapped off this shot. 2 seconds later she was up and gone. So I think this photo was more luck than planning and skill.</td>', 'Thank you all very much for your kind comments (and votes!) - they mean a lot to me. This is a really good website you have here - I''m having a ball and learning more about photography than from any other thing I''ve tried. The picture is of our 12 year old female german shepherd Clover. She''s deaf as a post, ricketty with arthritus, thinks she''s human, and the best mate you could ever ask for. We love her to bits.  As for the photo - I was out in the yard playing with my new 85mm f/1.8 when something caught her attention. I quickly hit the ground and snapped off this shot. 2 seconds later she was up and gone. So I think this photo was more luck than planning and skill.', '2007-10-03 21:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139384, 591798, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus effect that you got here. I think a little brighter may have help to bring a glow to the leaves, but when questioning falling you don''t always think of such things. :)</td>', 'I like the soft focus effect that you got here. I think a little brighter may have help to bring a glow to the leaves, but when questioning falling you don''t always think of such things. :)', '2007-10-03 22:53:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139405, 591457, 62318, '<td valign="top">I also like the angle in this, really brings the scene alive. Journalistic shots are so under rated on this site. The dominating blue color just adds that extra intelligence to the image.</td>', 'I also like the angle in this, really brings the scene alive. Journalistic shots are so under rated on this site. The dominating blue color just adds that extra intelligence to the image.', '2007-10-03 22:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139409, 591798, 40683, '<td valign="top">Both darkly menacing and serene, and the combination creates a lovely tension.</td>', 'Both darkly menacing and serene, and the combination creates a lovely tension.', '2007-10-03 22:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139415, 591798, 60614, '<td valign="top">Has aa nice dreamy feel.  It also gives me the feeling that I am under water and I am looking up at the leaves on top of the water.  I very interesting experiment.</td>', 'Has aa nice dreamy feel.  It also gives me the feeling that I am under water and I am looking up at the leaves on top of the water.  I very interesting experiment.', '2007-10-03 22:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139416, 591798, 26464, '<td valign="top">i just mated with this photo. <br/></td>', 'i just mated with this photo. ', '2007-10-03 22:59:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139639, 591457, 35669, '<td valign="top">thanks jayson, this at 50mm on full frame and not cropped so you can imagine how close I was :) so much fun</td>', 'thanks jayson, this at 50mm on full frame and not cropped so you can imagine how close I was :) so much fun', '2007-10-03 23:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139696, 591457, 32997, '<td valign="top">you''re a squirmy little bugger aren''t ya?</td>', 'you''re a squirmy little bugger aren''t ya?', '2007-10-04 00:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139738, 591703, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little over-smoothed for my taste, but the light is just stunning. Congrats on the well-deserved blue! :-)</td>', 'A little over-smoothed for my taste, but the light is just stunning. Congrats on the well-deserved blue! :-)', '2007-10-04 00:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139749, 591798, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love this because it makes me feel like I''m seeing through Ophelia''s eyes.</td>', 'I love this because it makes me feel like I''m seeing through Ophelia''s eyes.', '2007-10-04 00:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139915, 591224, 52549, '<td valign="top">Magical and dreamy, a beautiful image. Congratulations on top 10, Sean!</td>', 'Magical and dreamy, a beautiful image. Congratulations on top 10, Sean!', '2007-10-04 01:43:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139983, 591570, 84106, '<td valign="top">I live in Edmonton, Alberta, Canada, eh.  A little north of you.  Your great pic reminds me of the time I lived in Calgary which is very close to the Rocky Mountain foothills.  Keep that lens - it obviously performs well under difficult conditions!  Ya shoulda gotta top 10 finish!  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I live in Edmonton, Alberta, Canada, eh.  A little north of you.  Your great pic reminds me of the time I lived in Calgary which is very close to the Rocky Mountain foothills.  Keep that lens - it obviously performs well under difficult conditions!  Ya shoulda gotta top 10 finish!  Keep up the good work!', '2007-10-04 02:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140012, 590348, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Puckzzz:</b></div><hr/><i> I knew this was your shot. Because of the orchid :) nice shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>yes, rg does seem like a "soft pink flowers" kind of guy.</td>', 'Originally posted by Puckzzz: I knew this was your shot. Because of the orchid :) nice shot!  yes, rg does seem like a "soft pink flowers" kind of guy.', '2007-10-04 02:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140383, 591703, 67855, '<td valign="top">Hello<br/> <br/>Congratulation, this is the first picture in my favorites :)<br/>The skin''s saturation (tons chairs in french^^) are perfectly accomplished with the correction of the REds (-)<br/>Good technique (blur)<br/> <br/>Nice shot !<br/></td>', 'Hello Congratulation, this is the first picture in my favorites :)The skin''s saturation (tons chairs in french^^) are perfectly accomplished with the correction of the REds (-)Good technique (blur) Nice shot !', '2007-10-04 08:16:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140859, 589551, 48565, '<td valign="top">You were robbed!!! I love this-its the definition of soft.</td>', 'You were robbed!!! I love this-its the definition of soft.', '2007-10-04 12:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4141167, 591703, 78110, '<td valign="top">NICE!!<br/> <br/>damn those who give 5,4,3,1<br/>uh uh scary of competition..nice photo :)</td>', 'NICE!! damn those who give 5,4,3,1uh uh scary of competition..nice photo :)', '2007-10-04 14:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4141366, 591798, 11920, '<td valign="top">I would put this on my wall.</td>', 'I would put this on my wall.', '2007-10-04 15:41:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4141479, 591410, 41746, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Love the colors and softness and the amazing DoF. Never mind the DQ - this is a great photo.</td>', 'Excellent image. Love the colors and softness and the amazing DoF. Never mind the DQ - this is a great photo.', '2007-10-04 16:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4141689, 591703, 35187, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, you should be very proud of this image. it would have been a ten for me but i found the right hand side a little too over powering</td>', 'Lovely composition, you should be very proud of this image. it would have been a ten for me but i found the right hand side a little too over powering', '2007-10-04 17:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142075, 591214, 55838, '<td valign="top">I can''t understand how folks didn''t see the softness in this shot and I believe it''s a bit under-rated.  Nice colors and a cool idea.  Maybe people didn''t stop long enough to realize it''s a reflection.</td>', 'I can''t understand how folks didn''t see the softness in this shot and I believe it''s a bit under-rated.  Nice colors and a cool idea.  Maybe people didn''t stop long enough to realize it''s a reflection.', '2007-10-04 19:26:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142535, 591633, 61651, '<td valign="top">You did a really great job here - nice gradual movement from sorta-sharp to smoothly blurred.  I really like how all three give us a different point of view - straight on, partial profile and full profile!</td>', 'You did a really great job here - nice gradual movement from sorta-sharp to smoothly blurred.  I really like how all three give us a different point of view - straight on, partial profile and full profile!', '2007-10-04 22:10:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142541, 589167, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shade and silhouette to get your soft focus - this has a quiet and relaxed feel to it, makes me feel like I''m there under it, lying back and daydreaming.</td>', 'Nice use of shade and silhouette to get your soft focus - this has a quiet and relaxed feel to it, makes me feel like I''m there under it, lying back and daydreaming.', '2007-10-04 22:14:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142555, 591798, 61651, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8, it had a lot of appeal for me - you somehow managed to get that ethereal glow, which in other images is often used to make a shot "pretty", and coupled it with encroaching shadows and a whiff of menace.  Soft focus, and yet it teeters on the edge of nightmare - genius!</td>', 'I gave this an 8, it had a lot of appeal for me - you somehow managed to get that ethereal glow, which in other images is often used to make a shot "pretty", and coupled it with encroaching shadows and a whiff of menace.  Soft focus, and yet it teeters on the edge of nightmare - genius!', '2007-10-04 22:20:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142566, 591533, 61651, '<td valign="top">Those highlights on the smaller petals look like pearls.  I''m very glad you went dark with this - makes it a very interesting study of shadows and depth.</td>', 'Those highlights on the smaller petals look like pearls.  I''m very glad you went dark with this - makes it a very interesting study of shadows and depth.', '2007-10-04 22:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142573, 590496, 61651, '<td valign="top">Lovely luminescent trunks and great depth to this composition.</td>', 'Lovely luminescent trunks and great depth to this composition.', '2007-10-04 22:27:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142575, 591070, 61651, '<td valign="top">Best way to get soft focus naturally - the dappling of color is quite painterly, and spread randomly over the frame as it is makes this shot vibrant.</td>', 'Best way to get soft focus naturally - the dappling of color is quite painterly, and spread randomly over the frame as it is makes this shot vibrant.', '2007-10-04 22:29:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142578, 591820, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatically dark background and I love the title/concept tie-in - here''s to getting more adorable as time marches on! :)</td>', 'Nice dramatically dark background and I love the title/concept tie-in - here''s to getting more adorable as time marches on! :)', '2007-10-04 22:32:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142583, 590496, 40683, '<td valign="top">Ha...clever trick with the shower cap.  You certainly are a resourceful one.  There''s something about this that really draws me in.  I''m thinking perhaps it''s the glowing warmth in the color tones, combined with the delicacy of the leaves.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Ha...clever trick with the shower cap.  You certainly are a resourceful one.  There''s something about this that really draws me in.  I''m thinking perhaps it''s the glowing warmth in the color tones, combined with the delicacy of the leaves.  Beautiful image.', '2007-10-04 22:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142598, 589355, 61651, '<td valign="top">Perfect setting for soft focus, and overall you''ve got a very pleasing composition going, with the trees only glimpsed in parts.  I do find myself wishing we could either see more of the house, or none of it - the little we can see, especially given that what is most noticeable is the striking contrast of the white shutters, imo detracts from the over restfulness of the shot.  I don''t know if that makes any sense - I guess what I mean is that my first impression was to squint and go "what''s that in the middle of the shot?" instead of taking it all in with a more laid back gaze (the presentation overall suggests a laid back response was what you were going for).</td>', 'Perfect setting for soft focus, and overall you''ve got a very pleasing composition going, with the trees only glimpsed in parts.  I do find myself wishing we could either see more of the house, or none of it - the little we can see, especially given that what is most noticeable is the striking contrast of the white shutters, imo detracts from the over restfulness of the shot.  I don''t know if that makes any sense - I guess what I mean is that my first impression was to squint and go "what''s that in the middle of the shot?" instead of taking it all in with a more laid back gaze (the presentation overall suggests a laid back response was what you were going for).', '2007-10-04 22:42:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142602, 591298, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea to achieve soft focus in camera - when I first saw this I thought it was taken through a shower door.  Would be interesting to see shots of these, as the ice melted away.</td>', 'Very creative idea to achieve soft focus in camera - when I first saw this I thought it was taken through a shower door.  Would be interesting to see shots of these, as the ice melted away.', '2007-10-04 22:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142629, 591724, 61651, '<td valign="top">A Redneck in more ways than one, eh, Alan? That''s quite a burn you''ve got there.  ;)  So sorry this got slammed - soft focus is not easy to do. If you had more distance between yourself and the fence, the background would have been much more abstracted and blurred and you would have stood out more strikingly in front of it, even in soft focus (if that''s the sort of effect you wanted).</td>', 'A Redneck in more ways than one, eh, Alan? That''s quite a burn you''ve got there.  ;)  So sorry this got slammed - soft focus is not easy to do. If you had more distance between yourself and the fence, the background would have been much more abstracted and blurred and you would have stood out more strikingly in front of it, even in soft focus (if that''s the sort of effect you wanted).', '2007-10-04 22:55:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142638, 591605, 61651, '<td valign="top">So sorry for the DQ, so many got one in this challenge it seems.  Nevertheless this is really lovely - she has such a natural and relaxed smile, great direct-but-not-confrontational gaze, and the lighting is gorgeous - she really glows.</td>', 'So sorry for the DQ, so many got one in this challenge it seems.  Nevertheless this is really lovely - she has such a natural and relaxed smile, great direct-but-not-confrontational gaze, and the lighting is gorgeous - she really glows.', '2007-10-04 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142734, 591798, 67697, '<td valign="top">I saw this during the challenge and my first thought was that it looked like someone was photographing this underwater, looking up.  And everything was kind of swirling down.  The soft light creates a beautiful dreamy feeling.</td>', 'I saw this during the challenge and my first thought was that it looked like someone was photographing this underwater, looking up.  And everything was kind of swirling down.  The soft light creates a beautiful dreamy feeling.', '2007-10-04 23:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4142736, 591798, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool underwater effect. The dominant shadows make it feel claustrophobic, almost panic like.</td>', 'Cool underwater effect. The dominant shadows make it feel claustrophobic, almost panic like.', '2007-10-04 23:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4143408, 591605, 52549, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the DQ - but you''ve a really beautiful portrait here.</td>', 'Bummer about the DQ - but you''ve a really beautiful portrait here.', '2007-10-05 07:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4143435, 591703, 73221, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a wonderful image. I''ve watched your work for yrs now and you just keep amazing me with each one.We''ve missed you on snap :)</td>', 'Congrats on a wonderful image. I''ve watched your work for yrs now and you just keep amazing me with each one.We''ve missed you on snap :)', '2007-10-05 08:22:20.000000', NULL, 0);
